# Every screen from the title and back: Journey, Daily Challenge, Practice, Challenge, Score Chase
# (and a run started), Learn, Achievements, Settings (the captions option, the reset question),
# Help; Escape backs out of the list screens.
until 300 Cube Pop
frames 120
expect Journey 0/40
save title
click =Daily Challenge
until 60 Today's board (this device)
expect No scores on this device yet today.
save daily
click =Back
until 60 Play: First Pops
click =Practice
until 60 Unranked
save practice
key Escape 1
until 60 Play: First Pops
frames 5
click =Challenge
until 60 Constrained goals
expect Two-Tone Tangle
save challenge
click =Back
until 60 Play: First Pops
click =Score Chase
until 60 Your best runs (local)
expect No runs yet.
save score
click =Start run
until 200 Move bank
frames 150
save score-round
key KeyP 1
until 60 Leave round
frames 10
click =Leave round
until 120 Play: First Pops
frames 5
click =Achievements
until 60 Pop your first group of cubes.
save achievements
click =Back
until 60 Play: First Pops
click =Settings
until 60 Show text captions for sounds
save settings
key Tab 1
frames 3
key Tab 1
frames 3
key Tab 1
frames 3
key Tab 1
frames 3
key Tab 1
frames 3
key Enter 1
until 30 Reset journey stars, achievements, and saved rounds?
click =Cancel
until 30 Replay tutorial
frames 5
key Escape 1
until 60 Play: First Pops
click =Help
until 60 How to play
expect Orbit camera
save help
key Escape 1
until 60 Play: First Pops
